p1 meta lang.pattern.p1 stated "track daily habits from the terminal => concept habit.intro \"track daily habits from the terminal\"" @gen:e5b440b33cfef9c1
p2 meta lang.pattern.p2 stated "the habit log is stored in <path> => fact habit.logpath \"<path>\"" @gen:e5b440b33cfef9c1
